            ["Visual Studio で開いているときは、「プロジェクトが変更されました」の確認が出ます。再読み込みを選んでください。"] = new[] { "If the project is open in Visual Studio, a 'project changed' prompt appears. Choose Reload.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["{0} を追加しました。Visual Studio でビルドすると、自動でインストールされます (「今すぐインストール」は、先に入れたいときだけ)。CMake なら find_package({0} CONFIG REQUIRED) と target_link_libraries(...) で使います。"] = new[] { "{0} added. Building in Visual Studio installs it automatically ('Install now' is only for installing earlier). With CMake, use find_package({0} CONFIG REQUIRED) and target_link_libraries(...).", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["{0} を追加しました。ビルド時に自動で入れるには、下の「VS と連携する」を押してください。いま入れるなら、「今すぐインストール」です。CMake なら find_package({0} CONFIG REQUIRED) と target_link_libraries(...) で使います。"] = new[] { "{0} added. To install automatically at build time, press 'Integrate with VS' below. To install now, press 'Install now'. With CMake, use find_package({0} CONFIG REQUIRED) and target_link_libraries(...).", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["vcpkg は、C++ のライブラリを、ソースから自動でビルドして入れてくれる道具です。この窓は、それを動かす画面なので、まず本体が要ります。次のどちらかで入れられます。"] = new[] { "vcpkg is a tool that builds and installs C++ libraries from source automatically. This window drives it, so you need vcpkg itself first. You can get it in either of these ways.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["A. この窓から入れる (おすすめ)"] = new[] { "A. Install from this window (recommended)", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["git clone と bootstrap を、順に実行します。ファイルは数百 MB で、数分かかります。パスに空白や日本語がない、短い場所にしてください。"] = new[] { "Runs git clone and bootstrap in turn. It is a few hundred MB and takes a few minutes. Use a short path without spaces or non-ASCII characters.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["vcpkg を入れる"] = new[] { "Install vcpkg", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["環境変数 VCPKG_ROOT を設定する"] = new[] { "Set the VCPKG_ROOT environment variable", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["入れたあとに、VS と連携する (integrate install)"] = new[] { "Integrate with VS afterwards (integrate install)", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["git が見つかりません。先に Git を入れてください (Visual Studio インストーラーの「Git for Windows」、または winget install Git.Git)。"] = new[] { "git was not found. Install Git first (Git for Windows in the Visual Studio Installer, or winget install Git.Git).", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["入れるフォルダーを指定してください。"] = new[] { "Specify the folder to install into.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["{0} は空ではありません。空のフォルダーか、まだないフォルダーを指定してください。"] = new[] { "{0} is not empty. Specify an empty or non-existent folder.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["git clone に失敗しました (終了コード {0})。"] = new[] { "git clone failed (exit code {0}).", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["bootstrap に失敗しました (終了コード {0})。"] = new[] { "bootstrap failed (exit code {0}).", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["環境変数 VCPKG_ROOT を {0} に設定しました (ユーザー)。起動済みの Visual Studio には、再起動すると反映されます。"] = new[] { "Set the user environment variable VCPKG_ROOT to {0}. Restart any running Visual Studio to pick it up.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["VCPKG_ROOT を設定できませんでした: {0}"] = new[] { "Could not set VCPKG_ROOT: {0}", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["vcpkg を入れました。"] = new[] { "vcpkg installed.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["B. Visual Studio に付いているものを使う"] = new[] { "B. Use the one bundled with Visual Studio", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["Visual Studio インストーラー →「変更」→「個別のコンポーネント」→「vcpkg パッケージ マネージャー」にチェックを入れて、変更します。入れたあと、下の「もう一度探す」を押してください。付属の vcpkg は、一覧 (ports) を持たないので、検索には、A の全部入りが向いています。"] = new[] { "In the Visual Studio Installer choose Modify > Individual components > vcpkg package manager, and apply. Then press 'Search again' below. The bundled vcpkg has no ports list, so A (the full clone) suits searching better.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["Visual Studio インストーラーを開く"] = new[] { "Open Visual Studio Installer", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["自分で入れる場合"] = new[] { "Installing it yourself", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["git clone https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg を実行して、フォルダーの中で bootstrap-vcpkg.bat を実行します。そのあと、環境変数 VCPKG_ROOT にそのフォルダーを設定して、vcpkg integrate install を実行します。"] = new[] { "Run git clone https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg, then run bootstrap-vcpkg.bat inside the folder. Then set the environment variable VCPKG_ROOT to that folder and run vcpkg integrate install.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["vcpkg を使うかどうかは、プロジェクトごとに決められます。ON のプロジェクトだけが、vcpkg.json のパッケージを使い、ビルド時に自動でインストールされます (.vcxproj の VcpkgEnabled と VcpkgEnableManifest を書き換えます)。OFF のプロジェクトは、vcpkg に関わりません。名前を押すと、ON と OFF が切り替わります。ここに並ぶのは、選んだ vcpkg.json の下にあるプロジェクトです。"] = new[] { "You can decide per project whether to use vcpkg. Only ON projects use the packages in vcpkg.json and get automatic installs at build time (this rewrites VcpkgEnabled and VcpkgEnableManifest in the .vcxproj). OFF projects have nothing to do with vcpkg. Click a name to switch ON/OFF. The projects listed are the ones under the selected vcpkg.json.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["vcpkg を使うプロジェクト"] = new[] { "Projects that use vcpkg", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["すべて ON"] = new[] { "All ON", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["すべて OFF"] = new[] { "All OFF", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["vcpkg: ON。押すと OFF にします"] = new[] { "vcpkg: ON. Click to turn OFF", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["vcpkg: OFF。押すと ON にします"] = new[] { "vcpkg: OFF. Click to turn ON", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["vcpkg.json を作ると、ビルド時の自動インストールが使えます"] = new[] { "Create a vcpkg.json to use automatic install at build time", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["プロジェクト (.vcxproj) が見つかりません (CMake などは、vcpkg の連携が別に要ります)"] = new[] { "No project (.vcxproj) found (CMake etc. need their own vcpkg integration)", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["どのプロジェクトも、vcpkg が OFF です。使うプロジェクトを押して、ON にしてください"] = new[] { "vcpkg is OFF in every project. Click the projects you want to use it in to turn it ON", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["ON: {0} / {1} 個。VS と連携していないので、ビルド時の自動インストールは働きません"] = new[] { "ON: {0} / {1}. Not integrated with VS, so automatic install at build time will not run", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["ON: {0} / {1} 個。✔ ビルドすると、Visual Studio が自動でインストールします"] = new[] { "ON: {0} / {1}. ✔ Visual Studio installs automatically when you build", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["{0}: vcpkg を ON にしました (VcpkgEnabled / VcpkgEnableManifest = true)"] = new[] { "{0}: vcpkg turned ON (VcpkgEnabled / VcpkgEnableManifest = true)", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["{0}: vcpkg を OFF にしました (VcpkgEnabled = false)"] = new[] { "{0}: vcpkg turned OFF (VcpkgEnabled = false)", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["トリプレットは、「どの CPU・OS・リンク方式で作るか」の組み合わせです。x64-windows-static (おすすめ): ライブラリを実行ファイルに埋め込みます。DLL を exe の隣に置かなくて済むので、配るのが楽です。そのとき、プロジェクトの「ランタイム ライブラリ」は、マルチスレッド (/MT, Debug は /MTd) にそろえます。x64-windows (次におすすめ): ライブラリを DLL にします。exe は小さくなり、DLL を入れ替えるだけで更新できますが、DLL を exe の隣に置く必要があります。x64-windows-static-md: ライブラリは静的 (exe に埋め込む) ですが、C のランタイム (CRT) だけは DLL 版 (/MD) を使います。VS の既定のランタイム ライブラリ (/MD) のまま使えるので、プロジェクトの設定を変えずに済みます。ただし、CRT の DLL (VCRUNTIME など) は、配る先に必要です。プロジェクトの triplets フォルダーに置いた自作のものも並びます。"] = new[] { "A triplet is the combination of CPU, OS and link style to build for. x64-windows-static (recommended): embeds the libraries in the executable, so no DLLs need to sit next to the exe and distribution is easy. Set the project's Runtime Library to multi-threaded (/MT, /MTd for Debug) to match. x64-windows (second choice): builds the libraries as DLLs. The exe is smaller and you can update by swapping a DLL, but the DLLs must sit next to the exe. x64-windows-static-md: the libraries are static (embedded in the exe) but the C runtime (CRT) is the DLL version (/MD). It works with Visual Studio's default Runtime Library (/MD), so you do not need to change the project settings. The CRT DLLs (VCRUNTIME etc.) must exist on the target machine. Custom triplets in the project's triplets folder are listed too.", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["おすすめ"] = new[] { "recommended", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["次におすすめ"] = new[] { "second choice", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["/MD のままなら"] = new[] { "if keeping /MD", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["ランタイム ライブラリ: /MT (Debug は /MTd) にそろえる。DLL は不要"] = new[] { "Runtime Library: set to /MT (/MTd for Debug). No DLLs needed", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["ランタイム ライブラリ: /MD (VS の既定) のまま。DLL は不要 (CRT は除く)"] = new[] { "Runtime Library: keep /MD (VS default). No DLLs needed (except the CRT)", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
            ["ランタイム ライブラリ: /MD (VS の既定)。DLL を exe の隣に置く"] = new[] { "Runtime Library: /MD (VS default). Put the DLLs next to the exe", "", "", "", "", "", "", "" },
